1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,287
Some English words were born in war.

2
00:00:02,287 --> 00:00:04,333
Here are two from the Second World War.

3
00:00:05,533 --> 00:00:06,972
September nineteen forty.

4
00:00:06,972 --> 00:00:10,195
German bombers begin attacking London night after night.

5
00:00:10,195 --> 00:00:14,799
The British called it the Blitz, short for the German Blitzkrieg, lightning war.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:16,593
Word two.

7
00:00:16,593 --> 00:00:16,989
Radar.

8
00:00:16,989 --> 00:00:21,143
It is an acronym from the US Navy: radio detection and ranging.

9
00:00:21,143 --> 00:00:25,033
Today we just say radar, and forget it was ever five words.

